And you don't need to flash any original firmware before the OpenGD77, as it's a complete firmware written from scratch.<br><br>About the cable, as SA0BUX wrote, there is no chip inside. That means, if you plug the cable alone on a USB port, nothing will happen, no new device is added to the device manager.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=56">F1RMB</a> — Thu Feb 20, 2025 10:28 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
